  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership with UNDP for Climate Finance Network (CFN) - RDEL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Purpose of the project is to support Climate Finance Network (CFN) for improved Climate information services in selected countries,  better decision making, and reducing the exposure to climate risk, through regional cooperation and expanding access to more accurate climate and weather information services, including early warning systems.</narrative>
  </description>
